Body: <p>I am trying to display my markdown content from REST API to my NUXT3 application. I can get raw data with this</p>
<pre class="lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;h2 class=&quot;bg-slate-100 p-5 mt-5 border rounded&quot;&gt;{{ Services.data.Test[0].Title}}&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;bg-slate-100 p-5 mt-5 border rounded&quot; &gt;{{ Services.data.Test[0].Test_Data}}&lt;/p&gt;
