To use the `toSorted()` method in TypeScript, you need to import it from the `Array.prototype` or define it as a static method within your own class. Here's how you can do it:

```typescript
// Importing the Array prototype for toSorted method
import { toSorted } from "core-js/proxies/array";

class MyArray<T> extends Array<T> {
